      {
        "base": "https://www.wananga.com/feed/atom",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp-cdn.multiscreensite.com/md/dmtmpl/dms3rep/multi/blog_post_image.png\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           8th February 2024:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            THESE NIGHT CLASSES ARE CURRENTLY NOT BEING OFFERED AT TE W\u0100NANGA O RAUKAWA.\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           PLEASE KEEP AN EYE OUT ON OUR WEBSITE FOR ANY FUTURE NIGHT CLASSES THAT MAY BECOME AVAILABLE.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Carving Night Class\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            If you\u2019ve ever wanted to put your hands to the chisel and learn more about carving, now is your opportunity. This three week night class is open to anyone with a genuine interest in finding out more about\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Toi Whakar\u0101kai (Whakairo\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           )\u00a0 \u2013 come and experience the ancient language of our tupuna through the art of carving and make your very own p\u016bt\u014drino.\n            \r\n      <br/>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Start Date:\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0Thursday 10\u00a0 February, 2021\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Duration:\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0Three weeks\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Day/Time:\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0Thursdays, 6pm - 9pm, 2021\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Where:\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Carving Shed, cnr Tasman Road and Te Rauparaha Streets, \u014ctaki\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Cost:\u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0Fees Free\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Weaving Night Class\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Deepen your connection to Papat\u016b\u0101nuku through the creative, healing medium of weaving. For anyone with a genuine interest in enrolling in\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.wananga.com/diploma-in-design-and-art\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Toi Whakar\u0101kai (Whatu/Raranga)\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            in 2022. This is a small window into the world of weaving. Come and be immersed in the world of Te Whare Pora as expressed in our woven taonga of our tupuna. You will begin with the preparation of materials and creating a k\u014dnae.\n            \r\n        <br/>\r\n        \n            \u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        <span>\r\n          \n             Start Date:\n            \r\n        </span>\r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Thursday 10 February, 2021\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Duration:\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        <span>\r\n          \n             4 weeks\n            \r\n        </span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Day/Time:\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        <span>\r\n          \n             Thursdays, 6pm - 8.30pm, 2021\n            \r\n        </span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Where\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            : Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa, WRM Classrooms, 144 Tasman Road \u014ctaki\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Cost\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            : Fees Free\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Registrations are essential before\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Monday 7th February\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           due to limited spaces \u2013 call now to register your interest!\u00a0 Both are open to men and women.\u00a0 Please note vaccine pass required, preference given to wh\u0101nau interested in securing a place this year.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Call 06 364 9011 or email\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"mailto:tetomonga@twor-otaki.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           tetomonga@twor-otaki.ac.nz\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            to register!\u00a0 Download the\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/files/uploaded/Toi%20whakarakai%20Night%20classes%20Landscape%202021%20Folder.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           flier\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            to share with friends and wh\u0101nau!\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
